 global financial technology."}),s.jsxs("p",{children:["Founded by ",s.jsx("span",{className:"text-primary font-semibold",children:"Beritet David"}),', the platform introduces "Invisible Bitcoin" — a revolutionary system that enables cryptocurrency transactions through wireless radiofrequency body scanning, secured by multi-layered biometric authentication including DNA fingerprints, retinal scanning, and facial recognition.']}),s.jsx("p",{children:"The platform integrates a Non-Fungible Token (NFT) marketplace for trading innovative ideas and intellectual property, backed by virtual assets in encrypted electronic form. BERIDAV aims to partner with all major blockchain networks, SWIFT, and BRICS financial systems to create a unified global transaction ecosystem that also supports green energy evolution and climate change mitigation through electric mobility integration."})]})},{id:"background",title:"02. Background & Problem Statement",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"The current global financial system faces several critical challenges:"}),s.jsx("ul",{className:"space-y-2 ml-2",children:["Fragmented blockchain ecosystems with no unified interoperability","Security vulnerabilities in digital transactions","Lack of universal biometric verification","Disconnection between cryptocurrency and real-world utility (medical, energy)","Absence of a marketplace for intellectual property as valued digital assets"].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("li",{className:"flex gap-2",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-destructive mt-0.5",children:"▸"}),s.jsx("span",{children:e})]},t))}),s.jsx("p",{children:"Physical contact-based payment systems remain vulnerable to theft, fraud, and inefficiency. Meanwhile, the potential of radiofrequency technology — already proven in medical applications including anti-cancer ablation (RFA), chronic pain treatment, and cardiac arrhythmia correction — remains untapped for financial transaction purposes."}),s.jsx("p",{children:"Furthermore, the global push toward green energy and electric mobility lacks an integrated financial backbone to support seamless cross-border payments for electric vehicle charging, energy swaps, and carbon credit trading."})]})},{id:"solution",title:"03. Proposed Solution — BERIDAV Platform",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"BERIDAV proposes a unified platform that combines:"}),[{title:"Invisible Bitcoin Transactions",desc:"Wireless cryptocurrency transfers via radiofrequency body biochemical scanning — no physical contact required."},{title:"NFT Innovation Marketplace",desc:"A platform for buying and selling innovative ideas as NFTs — backed by virtual assets encrypted for electronic exchange."},{title:"Multi-Chain Integration",desc:"Seamless connectivity with SWIFT, all blockchain networks, and BRICS coin infrastructure."},{title:"AI-Powered Banking",desc:"Artificial intelligence linked as banking infrastructure, automating valuations, risk assessment, and smart contract execution for NFT idea transactions."},{title:"Green Energy Payment Network",desc:"Integration with all electric mobility locomotives to support green energy evolution and bridge the climate change gap through automated global payments."},{title:"Medical RF Applications",desc:"Tokenized payment for radiosurgery and medical RF procedures, including anti-cancer ablation and pain management."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"flex gap-3",children:[s.jsx("div",{className:"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/20 border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5",children:t+1}),s.jsxs("div",{children:[s.jsxs("span",{className:"font-semibold text-primary",children:[e.title,":"]})," ",e.desc]})]},t))]})},{id:"architecture",title:"04. Technology Architecture",content:s.jsx("div",{className:"space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[{layer:"Layer 1",title:"Radiofrequency Transaction Core",desc:"Utilizes advanced RF emitters and receivers embedded in wearable devices and environmental scanners. Transactions occur through electromagnetic wave modulation carrying encrypted blockchain payloads. Body biochemical signatures serve as unique transaction keys."},{layer:"Layer 2",title:"Biometric Authentication Engine",desc:"Multi-factor biometric verification: DNA fingerprint scanning (thumb-touch), orbital eye scanning (retinal + iris patterns), facial recognition mapping, and voice pattern authentication. Each biometric factor generates a unique cryptographic hash stored on-chain."},{layer:"Layer 3",title:"AI Banking & NFT Marketplace",desc:"Machine learning models evaluate innovative ideas submitted as NFTs, assessing market potential, uniqueness, and problem-solving capability (IQ-value metric). Smart contracts automate royalty distribution, licensing, and cross-chain settlement."},{layer:"Layer 4",title:"Global Integration Protocol",desc:"Bridge protocols connecting SWIFT messaging, BRICS payment rails, Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana, and other blockchain networks. Real-time settlement with automatic currency/token conversion for universal interoperability."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"rounded-xl bg-secondary/30 border border-border/40 p-4",children:[s.jsxs("div",{className:"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-xs font-bold text-primary bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full",children:e.layer}),s.jsx("span",{className:"font-semibold",children:e.title})]}),s.jsx("p",{className:"text-muted-foreground",children:e.desc})]},t))})},{id:"nft",title:"05. NFT Innovation Marketplace",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"The BERIDAV NFT marketplace redefines digital assets by treating innovative ideas as tradeable valuables. Unlike traditional NFT platforms focused on art and collectibles, BERIDAV creates a marketplace for:"}),s.jsx("ul",{className:"space-y-1.5 ml-2",children:["Patent-pending innovations and technological solutions","Research breakthroughs and scientific discoveries","Engineering solutions for climate change and sustainability","Medical treatment innovations and pharmaceutical formulas","Green energy technologies and efficiency improvements"].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("li",{className:"flex gap-2 text-muted-foreground",children:[s.jsx("div",{className:"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"}),e]},t))}),s.jsx("p",{children:"Each idea NFT is encrypted and backed by virtual assets, with AI-driven valuation based on the problem-solving capacity (IQ-value) of the underlying innovation. Revenue from sales is distributed through smart contracts to original inventors, collaborators, and the BERIDAV ecosystem."})]})},{id:"biometric",title:"06. Biometric Security Framework",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"BERIDAV's security architecture is built on the principle that every human possesses unique, unreplicable biological identifiers:"}),[{icon:"👆",title:"DNA Fingerprint Authentication",desc:"Thumb-touch scanners read unique DNA patterns at the molecular level, creating cryptographic keys that are biologically impossible to duplicate. Each transaction requires fresh DNA verification."},{icon:"👁️",title:"Orbital Eye Scanning",desc:"Advanced retinal and iris scanning technology maps the unique vascular patterns of the eye, providing a secondary authentication layer with 99.99% accuracy."},{icon:"🧑",title:"Facial & Voice Recognition",desc:"3D facial mapping combined with voice pattern analysis creates a tertiary authentication layer, ensuring transaction authorization even in compromised environments."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"flex gap-3",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-2xl flex-shrink-0",children:e.icon}),s.jsxs("div",{children:[s.jsx("div",{className:"font-semibold mb-1",children:e.title}),s.jsx("p",{className:"text-muted-foreground",children:e.desc})]})]},t))]})},{id:"medical",title:"07. Radiofrequency Medical Applications",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"BERIDAV's radiofrequency technology extends beyond finance into life-saving medical applications, creating a dual-purpose ecosystem:"}),[{icon:"🧬",title:"Anti-Cancer Ablation (RFA)",desc:"Radiofrequency ablation is a minimally invasive procedure used to treat primary liver cancer, liver metastases, lung metastases, kidney cancer, and Barrett's esophagus. Notably, RF radiation nano molecules found in scorpion venom have shown anticancer properties, representing a frontier in cancer treatment research."},{icon:"💊",title:"Pain Management",desc:"RFA treats chronic pain from the neck, lower back, and joints (knee), as well as pain from pancreatic cancer, ovarian cancer, and trigeminal neuralgia. The BERIDAV ecosystem enables seamless insurance and payment processing for these procedures."},{icon:"❤️",title:"Cardiac Arrhythmia",desc:"RFA restores regular heartbeat by disrupting abnormal electrical pathways. During the procedure, a needle-like probe is inserted and RF waves destroy problematic cells. Procedures take 30 minutes to 3 hours and can be performed through the skin, endoscopically, or via laparoscopy."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"rounded-xl bg-secondary/30 border border-border/40 p-4 flex gap-3",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-2xl flex-shrink-0",children:e.icon}),s.jsxs("div",{children:[s.jsx("div",{className:"font-semibold mb-1 text-primary",children:e.title}),s.jsx("p",{className:"text-muted-foreground",children:e.desc})]})]},t))]})},{id:"green",title:"08. Green Energy & Electric Mobility",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"BERIDAV will be integrated into all electric mobility locomotives worldwide to support the green energy evolution and bridge the climate change gap. The platform enables:"}),[{icon:"⚡",title:"Automatic Electric Swap Payments",desc:"When electric vehicles charge at stations, BERIDAV processes payments automatically through RF biometric scanning — no cards, no phones, just the driver's biological signature."},{icon:"🏠",title:"Electricity Bill Settlement",desc:"Radiofrequency electricity tokens can be used to pay household and commercial electricity bills, creating a circular economy for energy."},{icon:"🌱",title:"Carbon Credit Trading",desc:"NFT-based carbon credits traded on the BERIDAV marketplace, incentivizing corporations and individuals to reduce emissions."},{icon:"🌍",title:"Global Green Energy Fund",desc:"A percentage of all BERIDAV transactions is automatically allocated to renewable energy development projects worldwide."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"flex gap-3",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5",children:e.icon}),s.jsxs("div",{children:[s.jsxs("span",{className:"font-semibold",children:[e.title,":"]})," ",s.jsx("span",{className:"text-muted-foreground",children:e.desc})]})]},t))]})},{id:"partnerships",title:"09. Strategic Partnerships & Integration",content:s.jsxs("div",{className:"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed",children:[s.jsx("p",{children:"BERIDAV's vision requires deep integration with existing global financial and technology infrastructure:"}),s.jsx("div",{className:"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-3",children:[{icon:"🏦",title:"SWIFT Network",desc:"Integration with SWIFT messaging for legacy banking system interoperability."},{icon:"⛓️",title:"All Blockchain Networks",desc:"Multi-chain bridges to Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana, Polygon, Avalanche, and emerging chains."},{icon:"🌍",title:"BRICS Coin",desc:"Early integration with the BRICS nations' emerging digital currency initiative."},{icon:"🚗",title:"Electric Vehicle Manufacturers",desc:"Partnerships with Tesla, BYD, Rivian, and others for embedded RF payment systems."},{icon:"🏥",title:"Medical Institutions",desc:"Hospital networks and insurance providers for RF treatment payment integration."},{icon:"🔋",title:"Energy Providers",desc:"Utility companies and renewable energy producers for electricity token settlement."}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"rounded-xl bg-secondary/30 border border-border/40 p-3 flex gap-2",children:[s.jsx("span",{className:"text-xl flex-shrink-0",children:e.icon}),s.jsxs("div",{children:[s.jsx("div",{className:"text-xs font-semibold mb-0.5",children:e.title}),s.jsx("p",{className:"text-xs text-muted-foreground",children:e.desc})]})]},t))})]})},{id:"roadmap",title:"10. Implementation Roadmap",content:s.jsx("div",{className:"space-y-4 text-sm",children:[{phase:"Phase 1",years:"2025–2026",title:"Foundation",color:"from-cyan-500 to-blue-600",items:["Core RF transaction protocol development","Biometric authentication engine MVP","NFT marketplace smart contract deployment","Initial blockchain bridge (Bitcoin + Ethereum)"]},{phase:"Phase 2",years:"2026–2027",title:"Expansion",color:"from-blue-500 to-indigo-600",items:["SWIFT integration pilot program","Multi-chain bridge expansion (Solana, Polygon, Avalanche)","AI banking valuation engine launch","Medical RFA payment pilot with partner hospitals"]},{phase:"Phase 3",years:"2027–2028",title:"Global Rollout",color:"from-purple-500 to-violet-600",items:["BRICS coin integration","Electric vehicle manufacturer partnerships","Green energy payment network activation","Global regulatory compliance framework"]},{phase:"Phase 4",years:"2028–2030",title:"Full Ecosystem",color:"from-green-500 to-teal-600",items:["Universal RF biometric transaction availability","Complete multi-chain interoperability","Carbon credit NFT marketplace launch","Global green energy fund activation"]}].map((e,t)=>s.jsxs("div",{className:"flex gap-4",children:[s.jsxs("div",{className:`w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br ${e.color} flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0`,children:[s.jsx("span",